          "caption_lead": 0.029999999999999805,
          "caption_tail": 0.15666666666666718,
          "method": "10 ms speech RMS plus actual native text in/out; not forced word alignment"
        },
        {
          "id": "03",
          "text": "从资料里，找到依据。",
